Protocol and interoperability
=============================

Nux implements the Network UPS Tools network protocol as documented by the NUT
project (https://networkupstools.org). The NUT project's own Java client, jNut
(https://github.com/networkupstools/jNut, GPL-2.0 with Classpath Exception), was
consulted as a reference while implementing NUT 2.8 command tracking. No jNut
source code is included in or linked by Nux.


